_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQt8h5Q","user":{"login":"halfmanbear","id":89969229,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5OTY5MjI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89969229?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/halfmanbear","html_url":"https://github.com/halfmanbear","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/halfmanbear/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/halfmanbear/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/halfmanbear/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/halfmanbear/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/halfmanbear/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/halfmanbear/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/halfmanbear/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/halfmanbear/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/halfmanbear/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-25T21:14:24Z","updated_at":"2026-08-25T21:14:24Z","body":"Small correction for the HOTAS section: #105676 is listed under \"on Linux\", but it isn't platform-specific.\n\nI reproduced it on macOS (`master`, 4.8.dev b56a918) with an OpenTX RadioMaster Pocket — every axis reads `0.000` until the control is moved. The cause isn't in any platform backend: `SDL_SendJoystickAxis()` withholds motion events until an axis moves past a jitter threshold away from the first value it saw, and `drivers/sdl/joypad_sdl.cpp` only ever updates raw joystick axes from those events. 4.5, 4.6, 4.7 and `master` all have that same code path, so every SDL platform is affected.\n\nDetails and a tested patch in #105676.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5416886757/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]